WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.875
To sum up.

2
00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:03.709
You checked the security
initiative's enforcement

3
00:00:03.709 --> 00:00:05.950
mode and exported the month's compliance.

4
00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:09.275
You listed the exemptions with
their category and expiry.

5
00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:12.362
You walked the DDoS runbook
and the review calendar.

6
00:00:12.362 --> 00:00:15.409
And you computed two of the
guide's metrics as coverage,

7
00:00:15.409 --> 00:00:19.538
the kind of evidence that gets a finding
ready for the assessor's decision.

8
00:00:19.538 --> 00:00:22.340
The evidence an I S S O
keeps from this module:

9
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:27.787
the initiative and assignment exports, the
monthly compliance exports, deny events,

10
00:00:27.787 --> 00:00:32.923
the exemption register with its decision
records, the RACI and review calendar,

11
00:00:32.923 --> 00:00:34.791
review and exercise records,

12
00:00:34.791 --> 00:00:38.838
and accepted risks with the
authorizing official's signature.

13
00:00:38.838 --> 00:00:40.337
That completes the path.

14
00:00:40.337 --> 00:00:44.853
The guide's implementation checklist
puts all ten steps on one page,

15
00:00:44.853 --> 00:00:48.790
and a developer workbook, with
labs on fixtures, is planned.
